        <activityName xml:lang="en">Preservative treatment, sawn timber, pressure vessel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Preservative treatment, sawn timber, pressure vessel
For wood in permanent soil contact 9-18 kg/m3 of Cr-containing or 4.5-6 kg/m3 of Cr-free preservative is needed. For weather exposed wood 6-11.25 of Cr-containing or 3-4.5 kg/m3 of Cr-free preservative is required.;
Synonyms: mineralize, creosote; 
UUID: 2a60bbf7-3062-3384-8760-e3046e1da7ab
Impregnation process only. No wood nor preservative included. No transports included. No data on waste water available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Pressure vessel treatment
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2a60bbf7-3062-3384-8760-e3046e1da7ab.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
